WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.903
This is "Late Night." We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.238
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:08.040
The White House today
announced new initiatives

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.542
to combat junk fees.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:12.712
Sounds like somebody
tried to see Frankie Valli.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.948
"Convenience fee?

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:18.017
Jill, get Janet Yellen
on the phone."

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.919
House Republicans
today nominated Majority

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:22.055
Leader Steve Scalise
to be the next speaker,

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.924
while next week's Speaker
is still anyone's guess.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.726
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.361
Federal prosecutors accused

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.096
Republican Congressman
Jorge Santos

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:33.266
yesterday of stealing campaign
donors' identities.

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.401
But if you donated money
to Jorge Santos,

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:38.071
you're probably looking for
a new identity anyway.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.006
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.574
That's right.
Federal prosecutors

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.210
filed 23 charges
against Republican Congressman

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.579
Jorge Santos,
including two counts

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:50.216
of aggravated identity theft,
two counts of wire fraud

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.786
and numerous counts of trying
to make this look a thing.

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:57.090
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.692
A group of House Republicans
who call themselves

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:03.596
Okay for Only Kevin are
reportedly planning to nominate

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:05.731
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
for the speakership.

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:08.067
Unfortunately, a group
that calls themselves

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.802
F-K won't let them.

00:01:09.802 --> 00:01:12.304
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:14.674
At a campaign rally earlier
this week, former president

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.843
Trump said that he believes
former president Barack Obama

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:19.678
is in control
of the White House.

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:23.249
Yeah, right. You wish.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:25.451
And also we wish.

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:27.519
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.519 --> 00:01:29.956
In a new interview...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:33.259
...Vice President Kamala Harris
said that she loves her job,

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:34.627
though it was a little
concerning

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.063
that she said it in response
to every single question.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.098
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.567
According to a new report,
the super PAC affiliated

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:44.537
with Robert F. Kennedy Jr.
raised $11 million

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.505
in the 24 hours
after he announced

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:48.774
he was running for president
as an independent.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:51.811
Wow. Kennedy hasn't made
millions of dollars that fast

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.413
since the day he was born.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:57.182
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.182 --> 00:01:59.885
When asked to identify him
yesterday in court,

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:02.422
disgraced FTX CEO
Sam Bankman-Fried's

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.857
ex-girlfriend reportedly
took nearly 30 seconds

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:08.428
to recognize him because he
finally tried conditioner.

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:14.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:17.236
A library in Scotland
recently received a book

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:19.038
that was nearly
50 years overdue.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:20.639
The person would
have returned it sooner,

00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:22.575
but they were waiting
for a sunny day.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:26.445
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:29.482
Yeah, we'll [bleep] burn
Scottish weather.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:33.052
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.621
If not this week, when?

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.756
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:39.225
According to a new report,
Apple CEO Tim Cook

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:41.461
starts his day by reading
hundreds of customer

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:43.796
feedback e-mails
before going to the gym.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:46.298
Oh, wow. Sounds like Tim Cook
and I have something in common.

00:02:46.298 --> 00:02:47.767
We both like to lie.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:51.270
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.773
And finally, a cruise ship
in the Pacific Ocean

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:55.508
recently rescued a naked man

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.543
who was clinging
to a capsized boat.

00:02:57.543 --> 00:02:59.245
The man was able
to get a hot meal,

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.214
some clean clothes and COVID.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:04.383
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:05.385
We're off and running.

